   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>标注的真正成本在<b>一致性</b>：双人独立目估再第三方仲裁，比一个人标两遍能暴露的分歧多得多。混样记录决定哪些样品只能按「组分」标注——硬贴单标签是标签噪声的最大来源。洗样与捞样条件看似琐碎，却是防数据泄漏的分组成员。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>岩屑显微图像</span><span class='cl-s'>固定光照+标尺，单井 300—800 张</span></span><span class='cl-n'>每类岩性 ≥500 张建库</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>岩屑描述表</span><span class='cl-s'>井深-岩性-粒级-含油级别</span></span><span class='cl-n'>双人独立目估，仲裁后当标签</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>洗样与混样记录</span><span class='cl-s'>捞样条件、洗样时间、扰动情况</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于分组，避免数据泄漏</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>薄片/粒度分析</span><span class='cl-s'>关键层段的实验室定名</span></span><span class='cl-n'>校准疑难类别的真值</span></div></div>"
